# Removable singularities, domains, ranges, continuity.
domain (x^2-1)/(x-1)
continuity (x^2-1)/(x-1)
domain sqrt(x)
domain 1/sqrt(x)
domain log(x)/(x-1)
continuity sin(1/x)
continuity x*sin(1/x)
discontinuities 1/x
domain 1/(x^2-1)
range exp(-x^2)
range (x^2-1)/(x-1)
asymptotes (x^2+1)/(x-1)
zeros x^3 - x
